# Questline — project rules

You are building **Questline**, a gamified productivity app for university students: real tasks are judged by an AI (stat, difficulty, minutes), done in verified focus sessions, and turned into XP, levels, gear, cosmetics, deadline bosses, raids and a friends leaderboard. Six-person student team, about four weeks, **free platforms only** (Supabase Free plan, Groq free API, no credit card anywhere).

Stack: **Flutter** (Android demo, iOS builds) + **Supabase** (Postgres + RLS, Auth, Edge Functions in Deno/TypeScript, Realtime, pg_cron) + **Groq** free API for the AI judge, called only from Edge Functions (`docs/02-TRD.md` §7).

